<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Progression Guide | Fastest Upgrades & Tycoon Path" description="Learn Sell Lemons progression with early-game Juicer priorities, Cash Register automation, LemonDash logistics minigame, and Depot decoration secrets.">
  <main>
    <!-- Page Hero Section -->
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Starter Path</p>
          <h1>Ultimate Starter Walkthrough: Speedrun to Your First $10K</h1>
          <p>Welcome to Sell Lemons! Stop smashing low-yield buttons blindly. This zero-fluff walkthrough targets your exact early-game milestones—telling you exactly how to automate your stand, exploit NPC phone haggling, and break the early tycoon loop.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons starter progression guide" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Detailed Guide Content -->
    <article class="guide-detail">
      <h2>The 4-Step Actionable Walkthrough</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 1: The $450 Juicer & Early Ground Cash Grab</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Player Objective:</strong> Skip manual grinding and secure your absolute first chunk of pocket cash.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> When you spawn at your tiny Level 1 Lemon Stand, don't waste time looking around. Click the stand to generate $1 bills, but keep your eyes glued to the floor! Ground cash spawns passively and walking over it accounts for 20% to 40% of your pre-automation income. Hoard every dollar until you hit exactly $450 to buy the Juicer upgrade.</li>
            <li><strong>ROI Optimization:</strong> The Juicer instantly doubles your stand's payout. This is mathematically verified as the single highest return on investment in the entire early-game meta.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 2: The $2,100 Milestone — Breaking Finger Fatigue</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Player Objective:</strong> Escape manual clicking entirely so you can actively explore the map.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Now that your Juicer is running, push hard to accumulate your first milestone: $2,100. Do not spend cash on aesthetic base fences or signs yet. The second you hit $2,100, buy the Cash Register Automator.</li>
            <li><strong>ROI Optimization:</strong> This automator completely eliminates the manual clicking requirement. It permanently frees up your action economy, allowing your base to print cash automatically while you roam around tracking down map secrets.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 3: Squeezing Your First $10K via the LemonDash Haggling Meta</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Player Objective:</strong> Trigger massive, explosive burst payouts to rocket past the slow early-game grind.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Save up $17,000 to purchase the LemonDash Delivery Garage. This unlocks the delivery logistics minigame, which completely dwarfs the Lemon Stand's income speed. NPCs will start pinging your phone with delivery orders.</li>
            <li><strong>ROI Optimization:</strong> NEVER auto-accept a phone offer! NPCs will try to lowball you. Always use the counter-offer option to haggle. Countering by 25% to 35% above their initial price will force them to meet you halfway, easily netting you $8,000+ per delivery and securing your first massive capital pool within seconds.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Step 4: The Lemon Depot Decoration Trap Clearance</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Player Objective:</strong> Stop your cash flow from completely plateauing when you unlock the third tier.</li>
            <li><strong>Action Blueprint:</strong> Once you enter the wholesale Lemon Depot district, your progression might suddenly screech to a halt. This is due to the developer's infamous Decoration Gate System.</li>
            <li><strong>ROI Optimization:</strong> Many essential milestone upgrades are hidden until you purchase specific decorations. Buying the Depot Roof alone reveals 3 critical, high-yield progression buttons. If your build menu looks empty, buy the walls, roof, and lights, then walk physically through the warehouse to watch the hidden upgrade buttons spawn!</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>Golden Idle Strategies</h2>
      <section class="guide-step-card">
        <h3>💡 Strategy A: Burst-and-Sleep Offline Compound</h3>
        <p>Unlike generic tycoon games that nerf your earnings by half or cap your progress while you're away, Sell Lemons grants you 100% full offline income indefinitely. Collect your accumulated offline bank roll, spend it all on high-yield automated tiers, and log out.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="guide-step-card">
        <h3>🔄 Strategy B: The 350% Evolve Rule</h3>
        <p>NEVER Evolve (Rebirth) under a 200% investor bonus. Rebuilding without a heavy multiplier is a massive waste of time. Wait until your pending bonus hits the community-recognized 350%+ sweet spot. Once you reset at 350%, your powerful multipliers will let you buy back your automated stand loops in less than 60 seconds!</p>
      </section>

